{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927790/extras/240baa23e8679b59226872a0601697db.poster.avif?t=1761208263\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927790/extras/240baa23e8679b59226872a0601697db.webm?t=1761208263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927790/extras/240baa23e8679b59226872a0601697db.mp4?t=1761208263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join 2-8 players online or locally across 6 distinct game modes, where you'll tackle a variety of tasks or fight to be the sole survivor. Master the art of deduction as you identify real players hidden among swarms of unpredictable AI bots, all while hiding your own movements to avoid detection. Customize your experience with numerous gameplay modifiers that transform each mode into a fresh and thrilling challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927790/extras/856159330083c74d9f47ec13b2a2f615.poster.avif?t=1761208263\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927790/extras/856159330083c74d9f47ec13b2a2f615.webm?t=1761208263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927790/extras/856159330083c74d9f47ec13b2a2f615.mp4?t=1761208263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game is fast with a flexible round count to keep the action flowing. Seamlessly switch between game modes while the game tracks scores across all players, ensuring uninterrupted fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927790/extras/1536081e33a772776719e477689fd3e2.poster.avif?t=1761208263\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927790/extras/1536081e33a772776719e477689fd3e2.webm?t=1761208263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927790/extras/1536081e33a772776719e477689fd3e2.mp4?t=1761208263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with a mix of up to 8 players locally and online</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 game modes across 3 different maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise each gamemode with modifiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a game online quickly with the game lobby browser</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump between game modes with your friends to keep the fun going</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gamemodes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your friends: Blend in with AI bots and \u201cfind\u201d the other players, be the last player standing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunter: One or two players is a monster, the others must blend in with bots and complete the ritual before they are all found.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VIP: One team must defend the hotdog from the other team, the other must take them out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race: Be the first to the other side of the arena while not revealing yourself to the other players. Try and spot the other players and use your sniper to remove them from the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thief: Touch all of the golden statues before everyone else, keep hidden and take out rivals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Royal: The zone keeps shrinking, be the last player alive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made by a solo developer, your support means means a lot!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3927790?t=1761208263","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3927790?t=1761208263","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927790/d8fe7b2da4f6a08089c94f6707410cfb10ed178d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761208263","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927790/d8fe7b2da4f6a08089c94f6707410cfb10ed178d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761208263","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3941940,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927790/extras/240baa